      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## QuantFunc MiniMax-H3\n\n- **QuantFunc MiniMax-H3 Loader** replaces the official `Load Diffusion Model` (UNETLoader): the QuantFunc engine runs the H3 transformer, video and audio; the text encoder (`CLIPLoader`, type `minimax`), the video and audio VAEs and the sampler stay stock ComfyUI.\n- `transformer` from ModelScope [QuantFunc/Minimax-H3-Quantfunc-4bit](https://modelscope.cn/models/QuantFunc/Minimax-H3-Quantfunc-4bit), in `models/diffusion_models`: `minimax_h3_fl2va_4step_quantfunc_int4_r128.safetensors`.\n- From Hugging Face [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3): text encoder `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors` (the bf16 file also works), VAEs `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors` and `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`.\n- `audio_enhance`: ON adds a short extra pass that makes the sound clearer (most useful at few steps). It is not supported in two-stage (double-sampling) workflows: it is ignored there.\n- Input images: `flf2v_demo_first_frame.png`, `flf2v_demo_last_frame.png` from [Comfy-Org/workflow_templates](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/tree/main/input); use your own.\n- Size: 960x544 (multiples of 32), 124 frames (~5 s at 24 fps; frames are 17k+5).\n\n**First and last frame to video with audio.** The video starts at the first frame and ends at the last; either frame is optional (none: text to video). 4 steps, res_multistep / simple.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## QuantFunc MiniMax-H3\n\n- **QuantFunc MiniMax-H3 Loader** replaces the official `Load Diffusion Model` (UNETLoader): the QuantFunc engine runs the H3 transformer, video and audio; the text encoder (`CLIPLoader`, type `minimax`), the video and audio VAEs and the sampler stay stock ComfyUI.\n- `transformer` from ModelScope [QuantFunc/Minimax-H3-Quantfunc-4bit](https://modelscope.cn/models/QuantFunc/Minimax-H3-Quantfunc-4bit), in `models/diffusion_models`: `minimax_h3_fl2va_4step_quantfunc_int4_r128.safetensors`.\n- From Hugging Face [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3): text encoder `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors` (the bf16 file also works), VAEs `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors` and `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`.\n- `audio_enhance`: ON adds a short extra pass that makes the sound clearer (most useful at few steps). It is not supported in two-stage (double-sampling) workflows: it is ignored there.\n- Input images: `flf2v_demo_first_frame.png`, `flf2v_demo_last_frame.png` from [Comfy-Org/workflow_templates](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/tree/main/input); use your own.\n- Size: 960x544 (multiples of 32), 124 frames (~5 s at 24 fps; frames are 17k+5).\n\n**First and last frame to video with audio.** The video starts at the first frame and ends at the last; either frame is optional (none: text to video). 4 steps, res_multistep / simple.\n"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
